<para>Hull, John, White, Alan, 1999, <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_forward" kindref="compound">Forward</ref> Rate Volatilities, <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_swap" kindref="compound">Swap</ref> Rate Volatilities and the Implementation of the <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_libor" kindref="compound">Libor</ref> Market Model (<ulink url="http://www.rotman.utoronto.ca/~amackay/fin/libormktmodel2.pdf">http://www.rotman.utoronto.ca/~amackay/fin/libormktmodel2.pdf</ulink>)</para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000024"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>the correctness is tested by Monte-Carlo reproduction of caplet &amp; ratchet npvs and comparison with Black pricing. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
